    "introductoryText": "Splits a street address into three new fields: the **street name**, the **house number** and a **suffix** (the letter or addition that follows the number). Street first or number first, with or without a comma:\n\n- Kerkstraat 12A, Baker Street 221-B, Molenweg 7 bis, Baker Street 221 Apt B\n- 221B Baker Street, 14 Mill Lane, 8, rue des Lilas\n- street names in any alphabet, and names that contain a number (Straße des 17. Juni 135)\n\n**The field must hold the street and number only.** A flat or building before the number (\"Flat 3, 12 High Street\"), a town or postcode after the street, and number ranges (\"12-14 Market Place\") are not handled: put the town and postcode in fields of their own first. An address that fits no pattern gets empty street, number and suffix fields, and the block's message says how many there were. The house number is text.",
